1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,153
Welcome aboard Moonbird Air.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:07,221
Our next stop is Frosthavn.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:14,709
Beyond the ice, a small harbour waits on the edge of the Arctic.

4
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:30,396
Arrive with a ticket, and a little time to explore.

5
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:41,543
Meet the people who know these waters, and the lives built around them.

6
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:48,286
Find a quiet place where the ice opens.

7
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,680
Cast a line.

8
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,717
And learn the rhythm of the water.

9
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:11,739
Trade at the harbour. Make the day's work your own.

10
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:16,948
Stay a little longer.

11
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:21,803
Spring uncovers the rock beneath the snow.

12
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:26,246
In summer, sunlight stays past midnight.

13
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,058
Autumn brings colour to the tundra.

14
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:36,643
Then winter settles into a long blue twilight.

15
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:42,976
Beyond the last houses, another trail is waiting.

16
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:53,963
Follow it into the snow.

17
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:00,412
Learn with your hands. Build one layer at a time.

18
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:09,431
Pause where the landscape opens.

19
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:14,241
There is always more to notice.

20
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:22,898
Keep a field journal. Let small discoveries change the way you see this place.

21
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:27,246
And share the days along the way.

22
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:31,732
At day's end, a warm welcome.

23
00:02:34,100 --> 00:02:36,511
Follow the windows home.

24
00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:46,046
Frosthavn. A new Arctic chapter for Stardew Valley.
